Source of the legal texts: the Bureau of Experts at the Council of Ministers (هيئة الخبراء بمجلس الوزراء),
Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, laws portal https://laws.boe.gov.sa/ , read through Internet Archive captures.

Terms of use (https://www.boe.gov.sa/ar/Pages/TermsOfUse.aspx, capture 20261022175531): the portal is
"available for your personal use" (متاحة لاستخدامك الشخصي); the terms forbid loads that burden the portal and
interfering with it, and say nothing about copying, reuse or databases. No reuse licence is published. The
reuse terms are therefore unclear: this repository is private and is not to be published until they are settled.

Only the Official Gazette (Umm al-Qura) is authoritative. Every version after the original text of each law is
derived (replayed) from the portal's amendment notes by the method in REPRODUCE.md; it is not published by
the Bureau of Experts.

Attribution for the legal texts: "Texts: Bureau of Experts at the Council of Ministers, https://laws.boe.gov.sa/".

The history (commits and commit messages), the tables and the tools are dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
